            "notes": "The deck focuses on assembling a wide board of aggressive creatures with efficient mana costs and abilities that synergize well with white weenie strategies. The commander, Kellan, Daring Traveler, supports this strategy by providing card advantage and evasion for the combat phase. The deck aims to overwhelm the opponent with early aggression and disruptive cards like Thalia, Guardian of Thraben and Containment Priest. It also includes removal and protection spells like Path to Exile and Giver of Runes to ensure the creatures can connect with the opponent. The deck's goal is to apply constant pressure and force the opponent to respond to multiple threats each turn, ultimately leading to victory through combat damage."
